            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omumwaka ogw'akana, Yehoyakimu mutabani wa Yosiya oguyateriiremu engoma ya Yuda, Bbaruki mutabani wa Neriya obuyamazire kuhandiika ebigambo ebiyasomerwaga Yeremiya omurangi, Yeremiya akamugambira ekigambo kinu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wewe Bbaruki, MUKAMA Ruhanga owa Isirairi naakugambira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngu okagamba oti, ‘Ndikibona Imira nyowe Imira nyowe! Habwokuba MUKAMA, ha busaalizi bwange, ayongiireho obujune, ninyikara ninsinda, tinyina kahuumuro.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugambire oti: Eki nayombekere ninkiseesa, kandi ekinabyaire ninkimeenya. Eki ninyija kukikoraho ensi yoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA naakaguza ati: Nooyeserurra ebintu eby'ekitiinisa? Ebi otabiserra; abantu boona ninyija kubaleetera akabi; baitu iwe hoona nambere olikagenda, ndikulekera obwomeezi bwawe bube nk'ekisembo omuntu ekyatunga omu bulemu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
